{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/df86dd7c5a9b1b13cf361422b01d8a9a.poster.avif?t=1764459126\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/df86dd7c5a9b1b13cf361422b01d8a9a.webm?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/df86dd7c5a9b1b13cf361422b01d8a9a.mp4?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Claim The Throne</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood for the Throne is a tactical war strategy game with RPG-style progression. As a warlord in a brutal medieval world, you must lead your general and troops through relentless battles against monsters, rival generals, and entire kingdoms, all while striving to claim the throne.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command with Your Own Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your forces with specialized equipment, armor, and unique perks that define their combat style. Each general offers distinct traits and strategic bonuses, encouraging you to experiment with different playstyles. Will you overwhelm foes with sheer numbers, hold the line with disciplined infantry, or outflank them with swift cavalry maneuvers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e2ea8d958ad088caa181d9d0de1d2587.poster.avif?t=1764459126\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e2ea8d958ad088caa181d9d0de1d2587.webm?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/e2ea8d958ad088caa181d9d0de1d2587.mp4?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real-Time Tactic, Auto Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command your army in real time as battles erupt across the field. You can let your troops fight automatically while you focus on the larger strategy. Pause at any moment to issue precise orders, reposition formations, and launch coordinated strikes. Every maneuver and decision shapes the course of combat and the fate of your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/9683042f5c3b9a2640ff27cb6256fc22.poster.avif?t=1764459126\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/9683042f5c3b9a2640ff27cb6256fc22.webm?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/9683042f5c3b9a2640ff27cb6256fc22.mp4?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Campaign and Skirmish Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a sweeping campaign across dangerous lands filled with rival lords, roaming monsters, and contested kingdoms. Each battle requires careful strategy and tactical skill to emerge victorious. Outmaneuver enemies, make critical decisions, and test your general\u2019s leadership in a dynamic, branching journey through a richly detailed world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/db37b2481a5df2bd4dc301ccca589e1d.poster.avif?t=1764459126\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/db37b2481a5df2bd4dc301ccca589e1d.webm?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/db37b2481a5df2bd4dc301ccca589e1d.mp4?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two wars play the same. With a variety of generals, dynamic maps, diverse enemy types, and countless equipment combinations, every run offers fresh strategic choices and unexpected battles. Your strategy evolves as you choose war doctrines and unlock perks for your units, giving each campaign a unique rhythm and style. Adapt your approach, experiment with synergies, and carve your own path to power every time you march to war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/0f2c69b10af720dacfa86c600f3a3962.poster.avif?t=1764459126\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/0f2c69b10af720dacfa86c600f3a3962.webm?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/extras/0f2c69b10af720dacfa86c600f3a3962.mp4?t=1764459126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997440?t=1764459126","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997440/7aa225189123ae6d6cd1bcf5418f50d09dee2a87/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764459126","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto